                        ],
                        "form": "хо́ллах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f457ec7-4bd3-319b-b93c-a2ab0d555d84",
                        "entry_id": "39dba65b-d281-3458-a356-7b9c8749d4cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "помещение в общественных зданиях, предназначенное для ожидания, отдыха, встреч"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70638a6f-57b5-483d-bd58-6d41d32062ab",
                                "sense_id": "8f457ec7-4bd3-319b-b93c-a2ab0d555d84",
                                "text": "В великолепном холле гостиницы, устланном драгоценными коврами, близ стеклянных крутящихся дверей, важно прохаживался высокий человек, с седой головой и энергичным бритым лицом, напоминающим героическое прошлое Франции."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ebf4592-d8bc-309c-a423-22ced5feb716",
                        "entry_id": "39dba65b-d281-3458-a356-7b9c8749d4cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "большая передняя в квартире, доме"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32f98d0c-e851-4581-89ea-2044dbed84af",
                                "sense_id": "3ebf4592-d8bc-309c-a423-22ced5feb716",
                                "text": "Между гостиной и передней, в проходном холле, где было светло и пустовато, где среди плетеной мебели тепличной тишиной дышали цветущие растения, где за решеткой искусственного камина пылал мандариновый жар, Драйер, в ожидании гостей, читал английскую книжку."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ff6c6e8c-8d22-4b99-8a32-c488d25734a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "39dba65b-d281-3458-a356-7b9c8749d4cc",
                        "source_sense_description": "зал общественного здания, куда входят с улицы",
                        "target_lang_word": "lobby",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lobby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bacd1a38-ae6c-3488-8b8a-2d0a3e10a16e",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An entryway or reception area; vestibule; passageway; corridor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6b85dd6-d456-4b5a-813c-2ffd7a934049",
                                                "sense_id": "bacd1a38-ae6c-3488-8b8a-2d0a3e10a16e",
                                                "text": "I had to wait in the lobby for hours before seeing the doctor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45521634-6db9-39bc-a402-e0aeebba965f",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That part of a hall of legislation not appropriated to the official use of the assembly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a996f3b9-ebe9-3e76-a1a9-78edf23c5567",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A class or group of interested people who try to influence public officials; collectively, lobbyists."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b4cfa99-5450-4b0e-9939-b3349db57bd2",
                                                "sense_id": "a996f3b9-ebe9-3e76-a1a9-78edf23c5567",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: special interest"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "521f4646-298c-4778-89f6-8f650923d9a4",
                                                "sense_id": "a996f3b9-ebe9-3e76-a1a9-78edf23c5567",
                                                "text": "The influence of the tobacco lobby has decreased considerably in the US."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10c30f93-570d-30b3-9076-c68cb7cf62f1",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A virtual area where meeting attendees can await admittance from an authorized person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5a6f529-eadd-34e7-bda0-a784eb703055",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A virtual area where players can chat and find opponents for a game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc39fb63-1f8b-3ff1-ba68-01ad33940f6c",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An apartment or passageway in the fore part of an old-fashioned cabin under the quarter-deck."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "332d2b67-a7a8-3483-a4b9-2acadbe7dfdd",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A confined place for cattle, formed by hedges, trees, or other fencing, near the farmyard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d76e9bfc-2fd9-4fae-ae2a-215896dca00d",
                                                "sense_id": "332d2b67-a7a8-3483-a4b9-2acadbe7dfdd",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: cowyard, paddock"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e07762c5-459f-39e2-998f-5d02a5cc00a6",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A margin along either side of the playing field in the sport of kabaddi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c046f493-5306-31b8-aecb-969d9d88cf7a",
                                        "entry_id": "e583a426-dd78-338e-a699-e1e755b900ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A waiting area in front of a bank of elevators."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1914ebf2-0673-4244-910c-964eb265c33d",
                                                "sense_id": "c046f493-5306-31b8-aecb-969d9d88cf7a",
                                                "text": "Ranger Leslie Thompson, assigned to elevator duty, brought the elevator to the surface about 12:30 to bring down the tourists who were in the lobby of the elevator tower at that time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lobby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                        "entry_id": "692ce56a-af18-3552-af10-55af66deeff6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To attempt to influence (a public official or decision-maker) in favor of a specific opinion or cause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81f09181-6cc5-4353-b3d4-210a4f331e5c",
                                                "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                                "text": "For years, pro-life groups have continued to lobby hard for restrictions on abortion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80bb793a-e582-4e95-92e9-d700fa036da9",
                                                "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                                "text": "2002, Jim Hightower, in Wikiquote\nThe corporations don't have to lobby the government anymore. They are the government."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f35f0d1c-0361-4fa2-8b8f-af41a801509b",
                                                "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                                "text": "Allen Gregory DeLongpre: Yeah, it's not a big deal. I lobbied for fuel-cell technology on Capitol Hill. I'm friends with Sandy Bullock, really good friends. Who cares? It's not a pissing contest, right, J?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2df23ed0-0b28-414b-956e-ecb1922fea04",
                                                "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                                "text": "Policing the relationship between government and business in a free society is difficult. Businesspeople have every right to lobby governments, and civil servants to take jobs in the private sector."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db578006-7c15-427d-8378-9574b40bcc57",
                                                "sense_id": "b05e4b0f-3952-34f3-9596-d4045e8c286a",
                                                "text": "\"We're still at only 80% [of pre-pandemic passenger numbers], but it's great news that Southeastern put some more trains in the timetable from December,\" Perry explains. \"We worked very closely with Southeastern to lobby government and stakeholders to increase the timetable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lobby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03a250de-f46b-3051-bd44-e7cede5874c9",
                                        "entry_id": "933ac2a9-1db3-3ebb-b584-4462ca922c5f",
                                        "glosses": [
